# Environments
.venv/
venv/
env/

# Numeric caches / generated artefacts
*.npy
*.npz
# docs/figures/ is NOT ignored: those four PNGs are figures in REPORT.md, and a report
# whose images only exist on the machine that generated them is a broken report.
# Regenerate them with `python docs/make_figures.py`.

